{"seq":4,"slug":"reactivity-pitfalls","title":"响应式陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/reactivity-pitfalls","wordCount":694,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"响应式陷阱\">响应式陷阱</h1><h2 id=\"常见问题概览\">常见问题概览</h2><p>Vue 3 的响应式系统虽然强大，但在实际开发中存在若干容易犯错的场景。了解这些陷阱并掌握对应的解决方案，是避免难以调试的 bug 的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[&quot;响应式陷阱&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; P1[&quot;解构丢失响应性&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; P2[&quot;整体替换 reactive&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; P3[&quot;原始值访问&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; P4[&quot;异步回调中的旧值&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; P5[&quot;深层 vs 浅层响应式&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    P[\"响应式陷阱\"]\n    P --&gt; P1[\"解构丢失响应性\"]\n    P --&gt; P2[\"整体替换 reactive\"]\n    P --&gt; P3[\"原始值访问\"]\n    P --&gt; P4[\"异步回调中的旧值\"]\n    P --&gt; P5[\"深层 vs 浅层响应式\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>响应性连接</strong>：变量与响应式源之间的追踪关系，一旦通过解构、赋值副本或参数传值断开，更新就不再传播。</li>\n<li><strong>代理引用</strong>：<code>reactive</code> 返回的对象身份，整体替换变量会丢失组件持有的旧代理。</li>\n<li><strong>原始值访问</strong>：<code>toRaw</code> 取出未经代理的对象，<code>markRaw</code> 标记对象永不被代理，用于第三方库交互与显式跳过开销。</li>\n<li><strong>只读代理</strong>：<code>readonly</code> 深层只读、<code>shallowReadonly</code> 仅保护顶层，差别在于嵌套属性是否可写。</li>\n<li><strong>调试钩子</strong>：<code>onTrack</code> / <code>onTrigger</code> 暴露依赖收集与触发过程，用于定位响应式问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"解构丢失响应性\">解构丢失响应性</h2><p>这是 Vue 3 中最常见的陷阱——对 <code>reactive</code> 对象进行解构会断开响应式连接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { reactive, toRefs } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const state = reactive({ count: 0, name: &#39;Vue&#39; });&#10;&#10;// ❌ 解构后是普通变量，不再是响应式&#10;const { count, name } = state;&#10;count++; // 不会触发视图更新&#10;&#10;// ✅ 使用 toRefs 保持响应性&#10;const { count: countRef, name: nameRef } = toRefs(state);&#10;countRef.value++; // 触发更新，同步到 state.count\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { reactive, toRefs } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 解构后是普通变量，不再是响应式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不会触发视图更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 使用 toRefs 保持响应性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">countRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nameRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toRefs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">countRef.value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 触发更新，同步到 state.count</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同样的问题也发生在函数参数传递中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 传递属性值，丢失响应性&#10;function logCount(count: number) {&#10;  console.log(count); // 只是一个快照&#10;}&#10;logCount(state.count);&#10;&#10;// ✅ 传递 ref 或 getter&#10;function logCount(count: () =&gt; number) {&#10;  console.log(count()); // 每次调用获取最新值&#10;}&#10;logCount(() =&gt; state.count);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 传递属性值，丢失响应性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只是一个快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">logCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state.count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 传递 ref 或 getter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每次调用获取最新值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">logCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.count);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"reactive-整体替换\">reactive 整体替换</h2><p>替换 <code>reactive</code> 返回的代理对象会导致原始引用断开：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { reactive } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;let state = reactive({ items: [] as string[] });&#10;&#10;// ❌ 替换整个对象，组件仍持有旧代理的引用&#10;async function fetchItems() {&#10;  const data = await fetch(&#39;/api/items&#39;).then((r) =&gt; r.json());&#10;  state = reactive({ items: data }); // 组件不会更新&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 修改现有属性&#10;async function fetchItems() {&#10;  const data = await fetch(&#39;/api/items&#39;).then((r) =&gt; r.json());&#10;  state.items = data; // 保持同一代理引用&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { reactive } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ items: [] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 替换整个对象，组件仍持有旧代理的引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/items'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ items: data }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组件不会更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 修改现有属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/items'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  state.items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 保持同一代理引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th align=\"center\">是否保持响应性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>state.prop = newValue</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n<td>修改代理属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>state = reactive({...})</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">❌</td>\n<td>替换了整个代理引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Object.assign(state, newObj)</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n<td>批量修改属性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果确实需要替换整个对象，推荐使用 <code>ref</code> 包裹——<code>ref.value = newObj</code> 会正确触发更新。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"原始值访问-toraw-markraw\">原始值访问（toRaw / markRaw）</h2><p>有时需要绕过响应式系统访问原始对象，例如将数据传给第三方库或进行深度比较：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { reactive, toRaw, markRaw } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const state = reactive({ count: 0 });&#10;const raw = toRaw(state);&#10;console.log(raw === state); // false&#10;raw.count++; // 不会触发更新&#10;&#10;// markRaw：标记对象永不被代理&#10;const hugeThirdPartyObj = markRaw({&#10;  data: new Float32Array(1000000),&#10;  process() {&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;const appState = reactive({&#10;  renderer: hugeThirdPartyObj, // 不会被转为响应式&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { reactive, toRaw, markRaw } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> raw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toRaw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(raw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">raw.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不会触发更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// markRaw：标记对象永不被代理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hugeThirdPartyObj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> markRaw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> appState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  renderer: hugeThirdPartyObj, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不会被转为响应式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    OBJ[&quot;原始对象&quot;]&#10;    OBJ --&gt; |reactive| PROXY[&quot;响应式代理&quot;]&#10;    PROXY --&gt; |toRaw| OBJ&#10;    OBJ --&gt; |markRaw| MARKED[&quot;标记对象&lt;br/&gt;(永不代理)&quot;]&#10;    MARKED --&gt; |reactive| MARKED\">flowchart LR\n    OBJ[\"原始对象\"]\n    OBJ --&gt; |reactive| PROXY[\"响应式代理\"]\n    PROXY --&gt; |toRaw| OBJ\n    OBJ --&gt; |markRaw| MARKED[\"标记对象&lt;br/&gt;(永不代理)\"]\n    MARKED --&gt; |reactive| MARKED</pre><h3 id=\"使用场景\">使用场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>toRaw</code></td>\n<td>传给第三方库、深度比较、序列化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>markRaw</code></td>\n<td>大型不可变数据、第三方类实例、避免不必要的代理开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"readonly-与-shallowreadonly\">readonly 与 shallowReadonly</h2><p><code>readonly</code> 创建一个深层只读代理，任何修改尝试都会在开发模式下触发警告：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { reactive, readonly, shallowReadonly } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const original = reactive({ nested: { count: 0 } });&#10;const readonlyCopy = readonly(original);&#10;&#10;// ❌ 开发模式下会警告&#10;readonlyCopy.nested.count++;&#10;&#10;// 但原始对象的修改会反映到 readonly 代理中&#10;original.nested.count++; // readonlyCopy.nested.count 也变为 1&#10;&#10;// shallowReadonly 只保护顶层属性&#10;const shallow = shallowReadonly(original);&#10;shallow.nested.count++; // ✅ 不会警告（嵌套属性可修改）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { reactive, readonly, shallowReadonly } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> original</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ nested: { count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> readonlyCopy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(original);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 开发模式下会警告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">readonlyCopy.nested.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 但原始对象的修改会反映到 readonly 代理中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">original.nested.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// readonlyCopy.nested.count 也变为 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// shallowReadonly 只保护顶层属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> shallow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shallowReadonly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(original);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shallow.nested.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 不会警告（嵌套属性可修改）</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph ReadOnly[&quot;readonly 行为&quot;]&#10;        R1[&quot;readonly(state)&quot;] --&gt; R2[&quot;顶层属性只读&quot;]&#10;        R2 --&gt; R3[&quot;嵌套属性也只读&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ShallowRO[&quot;shallowReadonly 行为&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;shallowReadonly(state)&quot;] --&gt; S2[&quot;顶层属性只读&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;嵌套属性可修改&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph ReadOnly[\"readonly 行为\"]\n        R1[\"readonly(state)\"] --&gt; R2[\"顶层属性只读\"]\n        R2 --&gt; R3[\"嵌套属性也只读\"]\n    end\n    subgraph ShallowRO[\"shallowReadonly 行为\"]\n        S1[\"shallowReadonly(state)\"] --&gt; S2[\"顶层属性只读\"]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[\"嵌套属性可修改\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见响应式丢失场景汇总\">常见响应式丢失场景汇总</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>const { a } = reactive(obj)</code></td>\n<td>解构得到原始值</td>\n<td><code>const { a } = toRefs(obj)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>let state = reactive(obj); state = ...</code></td>\n<td>替换代理引用</td>\n<td>使用 <code>ref</code> 或 <code>Object.assign</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>arr[0] = newVal</code>（Vue 2）</td>\n<td>defineProperty 无法拦截索引</td>\n<td>Vue 3 已修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>setTimeout(() =&gt; state.count, 1000)</code></td>\n<td>闭包捕获的是值快照</td>\n<td>在回调中直接访问响应式对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>props.xxx</code> 传递给函数</td>\n<td>props 解构丢失响应性</td>\n<td>使用 <code>toRef(props, &#39;xxx&#39;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// props 解构的正确做法&#10;const props = defineProps&lt;{ modelValue: string }&gt;();&#10;&#10;// ❌ 丢失响应性&#10;const { modelValue } = props;&#10;&#10;// ✅ 保持响应性&#10;const modelValue = toRef(props, &#39;modelValue&#39;);&#10;&#10;// ✅ Vue 3.3+ 使用 defineProps 解构语法糖&#10;const { modelValue } = defineProps&lt;{ modelValue: string }&gt;();&#10;// 编译器自动处理，保持响应性\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// props 解构的正确做法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> props</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">modelValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 丢失响应性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">modelValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> props;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 保持响应性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> modelValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(props, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'modelValue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ Vue 3.3+ 使用 defineProps 解构语法糖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">modelValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">modelValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译器自动处理，保持响应性</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"调试响应式\">调试响应式</h2><p>Vue 3 的 <code>computed</code> 和 <code>watch</code> 支持 <code>onTrack</code> / <code>onTrigger</code> 调试钩子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ref, watchEffect } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;&#10;watchEffect(&#10;  () =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(count.value);&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    onTrack(e) {&#10;      console.log(&#39;依赖被追踪:&#39;, e);&#10;    },&#10;    onTrigger(e) {&#10;      console.log(&#39;更新被触发:&#39;, e);&#10;      debugger;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref, watchEffect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">watchEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    onTrack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'依赖被追踪:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    onTrigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'更新被触发:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      debugger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>解构 <code>reactive</code> 对象</strong>会丢失响应性，需使用 <code>toRefs</code> / <code>toRef</code> 转换</li>\n<li><strong>替换 <code>reactive</code> 整体引用</strong>会断开组件绑定，应修改属性或使用 <code>ref</code></li>\n<li><code>toRaw</code> 获取原始对象用于第三方库交互，<code>markRaw</code> 标记对象永不被代理</li>\n<li><code>readonly</code> 创建深层只读代理，<code>shallowReadonly</code> 只保护顶层属性</li>\n<li>使用 <code>onTrack</code> / <code>onTrigger</code> 调试钩子排查响应式相关问题</li>\n<li>Vue 3.3+ 的 <code>defineProps</code> 解构语法糖由编译器自动处理响应性保持</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"响应式陷阱","id":"响应式陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题概览","id":"常见问题概览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"解构丢失响应性","id":"解构丢失响应性"},{"level":2,"text":"reactive 整体替换","id":"reactive-整体替换"},{"level":2,"text":"原始值访问（toRaw / markRaw）","id":"原始值访问-toraw-markraw"},{"level":3,"text":"使用场景","id":"使用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"readonly 与 shallowReadonly","id":"readonly-与-shallowreadonly"},{"level":2,"text":"常见响应式丢失场景汇总","id":"常见响应式丢失场景汇总"},{"level":2,"text":"调试响应式","id":"调试响应式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"computed 与 watch","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/computed-and-watch"},"next":{"title":"setup 与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/setup-and-lifecycle"}}